Package: archon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: protontricks
Description: Linux-native archive browser and mod tool for GTA V
 ARCHON browses and edits the archives of GTA V (Legacy and Enhanced) on
 Linux: RPF archives, texture dictionaries, models, metadata, OIV packages,
 ASI plugins and the Proton prefix, with every change backed up and
 reversible.
